<title>INDIA: India Essar Ship 96/97 1st half net up.</title>
<headline>India Essar Ship 96/97 1st half net up.</headline>
<dateline>BOMBAY 1996-11-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months to September 30, 1996</p>
<p>	     (in million rupees unless stated)</p>
<p>    Net profit	270.6    vs     236.3</p>
<p>    Total income  1,456.3    vs   1,796.6</p>
<p>    Other income     84.0    vs	93.5</p>
<p>    Expenditure     581.7    vs     754.7</p>
<p>    Interest	  261.1    vs     379.0</p>
<p>    Depreciation    151.1    vs     255.6</p>
<p>    Tax		  Nil     vs	Nil</p>
<p>Note: Essar Shipping Ltd, belonging to the private Essar group, said the results are unaudited.</p>
<p>-- Bombay newsroom 91-22-265 9000</p>
</text>
